Dialogue: 50,0:00:14.08,0:00:15.41,Main,SAMURAI B,0,0,0,,Now, fair and square.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.66,0:00:18.04,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Fair?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.92,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.96,Main,SAMURAI B,0,0,0,,Ah! He's running! \NHe turned tail and ran!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.01,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.39,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Since the Sword Ban nobody does this \Nkind of samurai swordplay stuff anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.46,0:00:37.92,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,Gintoki Sakata. His trademark is his naturally curly hair.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.92,0:00:40.63,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,He has a sweet tooth and high blood-sugar.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:40.63,0:00:43.40,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,and he's kinda the main character.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:44.95,0:00:46.11,Main,SAMURAI,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:46.49,0:00:49.49,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have a TV show to watch at four.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.30,0:00:52.66,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:52.91,0:00:53.78,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shinpachi?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.03,0:00:56.70,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin, help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:57.17,0:00:59.50,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Shinpachi Shimura. The straight man.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:59.50,0:01:03.13,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,Working for Gintoki in hopes \Nof finding the samurai spirit.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:03.44,0:01:06.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you letting \Nthem chase you like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.06,0:01:09.67,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's not like I enjoy being chased!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:09.93,0:01:11.71,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Anyway, run for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:11.71,0:01:13.55,Main,SAMURAI,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.16,0:01:34.07,Main,SAMURAI,0,0,0,,We've got you now...  Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.07,0:01:36.70,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Gin! It's not over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.26,0:01:41.41,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,Kagura, a member of the universe's \Nstrongest race, the Yato Clan.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:41.41,0:01:44.57,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,Despite her cuteness, \Nshe's got quite a sharp tongue.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.57,0:01:46.09,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.21,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.21,0:01:50.70,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Sadaharu, Kagura's pet.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.70,0:01:52.47,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,A mysterious, giant space creature.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.47,0:01:56.56,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Geez, pay attention! I think they're pissed.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.56,0:01:59.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,K-Kagura. You'd better get out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.24,0:02:07.02,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Ladies 4 is about to start.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.27,0:02:10.18,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,The host, Toshio Shiba, will wait for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.05,0:02:11.03,Secondary,SAMURAI,0,0,0,,{\move(380,510,380,546,1163,1450)}After them!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.29,0:02:12.85,Main,SAMURAI,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.85,0:02:14.11,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.33,0:02:22.39,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,A dead end...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.36,0:02:28.84,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,End of the line for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.84,0:02:32.17,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? \NWe let you catch us.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.59,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You should be thankful!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.31,Main,SAMURAI B,0,0,0,,What? You sore losers!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.31,0:02:37.75,Main,SAMURAI B,0,0,0,,You're the ones running all \Nover town. You should talk!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.75,0:02:39.22,Main,SAMURAI C,0,0,0,,What group do you belong to?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.63,Main,SAMURAI D,0,0,0,,You must be the spy \Nwho came to find our secret.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.63,0:02:47.52,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,Before we cut you down, \NI'll ask you again. Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.52,0:02:49.33,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Who are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.33,0:02:52.15,Main,SHINACHI,0,0,0,,Hah... All right, since you asked...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.50,0:02:56.53,Main,SHINACHI,0,0,0,,We do anything from housework \Nto finding missing persons!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.49,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,If you're in trouble, just come to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.05,0:03:04.02,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,We'll take any case. We'll take any \Nkind of job as long as we get paid.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.02,0:03:07.29,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,We're Odd Jobs Gin!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.29,0:03:10.91,Main,SAMURAI D,0,0,0,,Odd Jobs? You mean, you'll do anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.91,0:03:15.20,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,I see. So someone hired you to sneak \Ninto our factory facility and...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.05,0:03:20.63,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.60,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That must be it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.60,0:03:24.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That's Yamatoya's cat, Kuromi!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.05,0:03:28.23,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Come on. Have some pickled seaweed.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.32,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, you damned cat! Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.32,0:03:36.74,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,They were looking for a cat?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.83,0:05:31.61,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The land of the samurai.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.61,0:05:35.57,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,There was a time, long ago, \Nwhen our country was called by that name.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.57,0:05:42.24,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,With the arrival of the "Amanto" from outer \Nspace and the Sword Ban twenty years ago,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.24,0:05:44.38,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,the samurai class fell into decline.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.99,0:05:49.12,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,In such hard times, there was one man \Nstill left with the spirit of the samurai.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.58,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,His name is Gintoki Sakata.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.73,0:05:59.67,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Kagura and I, Shinpachi Shimura, \Nwork at Odd Jobs Gin, which is run by this guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.17,0:06:03.59,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Which reminds me, we've been working \Nfor him for about a year now,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.59,0:06:06.10,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,but I don't think he's paid us yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.86,0:06:17.77,Main,WAITRESS,0,0,0,,Mr. Kariya has arrived!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.83,0:06:20.53,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.84,0:06:22.53,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.94,0:06:25.33,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,I can't hear you! Again!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.91,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.91,0:06:27.87,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.87,0:06:31.20,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Still not enough! Care to try it again?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.20,0:06:34.17,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,No, there's no time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.17,0:06:35.29,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.02,0:06:38.17,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,These are today's guest characters.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.38,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,They're definitely not regulars.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.64,0:06:43.59,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Well, well, Mr. Kariya.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.18,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming all this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.52,0:06:47.93,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Stop with the formalities.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.93,0:06:50.18,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,So, how is that matter we talked about going?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.45,0:06:53.53,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Fine. Everything is going very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.53,0:06:56.19,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,First, please take a look at this proposal.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.41,0:06:59.67,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,The goal of the project...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.67,0:07:00.52,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,"This project is... "
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.61,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,I have no idea what this means!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.14,0:07:06.67,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Is this a presentation \Nfor the spring anime season or what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.30,0:07:11.20,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.53,0:07:20.43,Main,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.81,0:07:26.06,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,The Shinsengumi.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.06,0:07:27.89,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,A special government police force.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.67,0:07:31.39,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Hijikata. Vice-chief of Shinsengumi. He's the brains.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.09,0:07:34.89,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Okita. One of the Shinsengumi's best swordsmen.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.65,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Yamazaki, sit-rep?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.65,0:07:39.97,Main,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,They're in a private meeting \Nin the back room on the second floor.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.97,0:07:45.62,Main,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Four of them: one Amanto, \Ntwo businessmen and one tough-looking ronin...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.62,0:07:47.07,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Great...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.10,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.86,0:07:51.37,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Speaking of the Amanto device, \Nwhich we obtained with Mr. Kariya's support...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.37,0:07:55.19,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,We just finished assembling it \Nat our secret factory.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.19,0:07:58.29,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,All we need to do is get it into position.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.93,0:08:03.42,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,If this project succeeds, \Nall of Edo will fall under my control.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.42,0:08:06.22,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,That's right, Mr. Kariya.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:11.41,0:08:12.76,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,This is a raid!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.56,Main,MEMBER A,0,0,0,,It's the Shinsengumi! Everyone stay still!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.56,0:08:15.82,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Sogo! Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.82,0:08:16.43,Main,OKITA,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.11,0:08:24.19,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Freeze, Shinsengumi!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.54,Main,OKITA (M),0,0,0,,Good-bye, Vice-chief.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.54,0:08:32.91,Main,OKITA (M),0,0,0,,Hope you enjoy sucking \Non mayonnaise in the next world.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.96,0:08:39.57,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Hey, Sogo, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.37,0:08:43.27,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Hey, were you trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.27,0:08:46.38,Main,OKITA,0,0,0,,No way, it was a joke. A joke, you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.38,0:08:48.13,Main,OKITA,0,0,0,,Don't I always joke like this with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.13,0:08:51.47,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You mean you're always trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.87,0:08:56.69,Main,OKITA,0,0,0,,Anyway, Hijikata, it seems \Nthat all our efforts end in failure.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.95,0:08:58.97,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.97,0:09:00.44,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.96,0:09:06.69,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.94,0:09:13.44,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm too old to be reading JUMP. \NBut I just bought it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.23,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That's right, Gin.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.23,0:09:18.60,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Reading manga like \Nthat won't fill your stomach.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.58,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Your blood-sugar level will remain the same.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.58,0:09:24.09,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Even so, it's kind of like an addiction.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.09,0:09:26.72,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I keep thinking I won't buy the next one, but...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.72,0:09:28.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin, this is terrible.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.96,0:09:32.85,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I know. It's terrible for someone \Nmy age to be reading JUMP.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.85,0:09:36.21,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Yeah the riceball you made is terrible.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.21,0:09:37.52,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't mean either of those!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.89,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I'm talking about this.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.89,0:09:41.52,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,A bankbook?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.52,0:09:45.94,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Hah, you can't fool me. \NYou can't eat that.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.94,0:09:48.20,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We won't be able to eat anything, not even rice!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.20,0:09:51.99,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Our balance is almost zero, \Nso I feel really blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.99,0:09:55.41,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We failed to catch the missing cat \Nyesterday, so it was all for nothing!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.79,0:10:00.11,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Calm down. You're the little punk \Nwho failed to buy JUMP, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.11,0:10:03.49,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Having no money is just a condition, \Nlike chronic nasal infection, you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.49,0:10:08.92,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Get used to it. Having \Nno money is our destiny.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.92,0:10:11.43,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.43,0:10:14.65,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about JUMP! \NWe're in a real picke!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.65,0:10:17.79,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Even bread crust would be like \Na feast tomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.78,0:10:19.31,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.55,0:10:20.16,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,A nasal infection?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.16,0:10:21.52,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake, moron!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.71,0:10:26.32,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It stopped.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.32,0:10:29.00,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We're having a lot of earthquakes lately.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.00,0:10:32.96,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's shaking like a high school \Nboy who has to simultaneously confront
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.96,0:10:34.74,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,all five girls who asked him out.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.74,0:10:37.37,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,As if that ever happens.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.37,0:10:39.93,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But it could happen in JUMP.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.28,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Customer?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.28,0:10:44.71,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It can't be. It's probably \Na newspaper salesman or something.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.09,0:10:47.51,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shinpachi, if he's from \Nanywhere other than the Nikkei,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.51,0:10:49.80,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,tell him that we subscribe \Nalready and send him away.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.80,0:10:53.83,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,And if he is from Nikkei, send him \Naway gently, like the rising sun.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.34,0:10:56.95,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.58,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We're already subscribed to a newspaper.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.58,0:10:59.97,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.49,0:11:09.27,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.74,0:11:14.27,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I'm here because I heard \Nyou guys will take any job.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.00,0:11:16.03,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.03,0:11:21.04,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Shinpachi, what are you doing? \N"Lady's Four" is about to start!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.62,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I heard this is Odd Jobs Gin.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.22,0:11:25.41,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,...frigging...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.41,0:11:29.01,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What's wrong? \NCan't get rid of this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.01,0:11:31.96,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,He's not trying to strongarm you, is he?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.42,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,This is Odd Jobs, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.51,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,...way!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.51,0:11:36.07,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.07,0:11:36.51,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,...frigging...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.51,0:11:37.59,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,...way!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.64,0:11:41.10,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Hello? Hello? Hey, all three of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.52,0:11:43.84,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can't be...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.63,0:11:45.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Are you a client?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.35,0:11:51.53,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Ken Kato. Ronin. This episode's client.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.40,0:11:56.26,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself. \NMy name is Ken Kato.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.26,0:11:58.45,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I've been a ronin for a few days now.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.01,0:12:01.76,Main,GINTOKI (whisper),0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.76,0:12:03.99,Main,KAGURA (whisper),0,0,0,,We've had clients two days in row?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.70,Main,KAGURA (whisper),0,0,0,,Must be a special version of the show!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.01,0:12:09.19,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,H-Here's some tea for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.19,0:12:09.90,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Hot!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.90,0:12:10.75,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.75,0:12:11.88,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.30,0:12:14.46,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You're really in for it if this is a joke!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.71,0:12:17.51,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What? You're shocked and getting uppity?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.89,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,So what can we do for you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.89,0:12:25.14,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Well, I... want to get something back that I lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.23,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Something very important to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.65,0:12:32.94,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Well, what did you lose?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.94,0:12:36.52,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Well...  I need about thirty \Nmillion yen to get it back.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.52,0:12:40.66,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Listen, baldy! I said you were in for it \Nif this was a joke, remember?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.33,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What's an easy way to earn money?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.33,0:12:46.95,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Every time I grab it, \Nit runs through my fingers...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.95,0:12:50.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,So that's the cause! \NThat hand gambled away our finances.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.96,0:12:54.46,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,But I heard you would take any \Nkinds of jobs for troubled people.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.34,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,We can't even pay our rent now!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.34,0:12:59.24,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,There's no way we can take \Ncare of someone's business!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.97,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Don't come here again!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.81,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Calm down, you two.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.81,0:13:07.35,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,So, what would you do \Nwith the money if you had it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.23,0:13:12.73,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I was sidelined in my job and a month ago, \NI graduated into unemployement.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.86,0:13:19.40,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,And three weeks ago, \NI was swindled and lost my house.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.70,0:13:25.95,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Then two weeks ago, my wife and daughter \Nleft me, without even leaving a note.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.08,0:13:29.50,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,And one week ago...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.68,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why did you stop?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.68,0:13:43.52,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Spit it out! Do tragedies like \Nthis befall you every single week?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.52,0:13:47.01,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Tell us what happened to you last week!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.01,0:13:50.13,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Would you... like to hear the rest?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.31,0:13:57.09,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Why will he tell us the rest only \Nafter we complete the job?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.09,0:14:00.40,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Well, I doubt we'll ever be able to \Nfinish it in the first place.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.06,0:14:02.32,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.32,0:14:03.66,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.96,0:14:08.70,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,{\pos(380,544.93)}Well...  The point is that we get \Nthe money as quickly as possible, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.71,0:14:12.71,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Welcome...  Oh, it's you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.27,0:14:14.39,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Otose.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.39,0:14:18.09,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,{\q2}Proprietor of Otose's Snack House and Gintoki's landlord.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.09,0:14:21.76,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.76,0:14:23.69,Main,CATHERINE,0,0,0,,You guys are such dopes.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.69,0:14:29.47,Main,CATHERINE,0,0,0,,If you could make money that quickly, \Nthere would be no thieves in the world! Idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.47,0:14:31.74,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,So says the ex-thief!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.74,0:14:32.81,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.15,0:14:36.06,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Catherine. Works for Otose's Snack House.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.06,0:14:38.11,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,She came to Earth as a migrant worker.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.32,0:14:43.65,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like there are no options left...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.29,0:14:47.49,Main,DOCTOR,0,0,0,,So, what'll it be?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.49,0:14:49.37,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Well,  I...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.37,0:14:52.57,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,You've got two of those, \Nso why don't you sell one?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.57,0:14:54.73,Main,OTOSE,0,0,0,,Just do it, if you've got any balls.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,This isn't gonna work.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.23,0:14:59.17,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,So disappointing. \NYou're just a big talker.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.61,0:15:03.29,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It's not going to happen \Nif you're not prepared, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.29,0:15:06.26,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,There's no way a sane person would do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.16,0:15:14.06,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Oh hello, everyone. \NFancy meeting you here!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.51,0:15:17.29,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Ayame Sarutobi. Nickname: Sachan.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.52,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,An elite ninja and a former \Na member of the Oniwabanshu.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.05,0:15:21.11,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.11,0:15:24.11,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,A way to get money quickly?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:24.11,0:15:27.09,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sachan, why don't you put your glasses on?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.09,0:15:29.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You're really bothering other people here.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.64,0:15:31.33,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I don't care if your character looks like mine.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.93,0:15:33.58,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.58,0:15:37.41,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.41,0:15:39.08,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,All I care about is...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.11,0:15:44.21,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,...you, Gin.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.18,0:15:48.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I keep telling you to put on your glasses!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.10,0:15:49.89,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.89,0:15:54.14,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,So the money you were talking about is not \Nfor the purchase of our little love nest?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.71,0:15:56.89,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Our love nest?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.89,0:15:59.81,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Man, I can't even bear to think \Nabout sitting next to you at the diner.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.81,0:16:01.90,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Always so cold, as usual.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.90,0:16:04.69,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,But I don't give up so easily.
Comment: 50,0:16:05.09,0:16:10.70,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,{\an8}[natto = fermented soy beans; popular as a diet food]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.52,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,And what's with the natto, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.52,0:16:10.57,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Just holding on to it isn't gonna \Nhelp you you'll lose weight. Seriously.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.57,0:16:14.98,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Oh? Do you think that pushing me \Naway is going to make me happy?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.98,0:16:19.32,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Stop blabbering, and do something \Nabout the natto, you natto woman!
Comment: 50,0:16:15.65,0:16:16.77,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.47,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,That's it! Just like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.47,0:16:26.42,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,More! More! Just keep blasting away at me!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.42,0:16:29.18,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,You're really turning me on!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.69,0:16:30.55,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What's this? It stinks!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.55,0:16:31.65,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What's that smell?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.65,0:16:34.47,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Smells like natto and masochism.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.85,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Kato.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.49,0:16:37.85,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Kato.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.56,0:16:44.20,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Yo, Kato. How's it going?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.80,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.65,0:16:50.60,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,I bet that was hard on you, huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.60,0:16:52.76,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,You put your seal on a contract like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.76,0:16:55.28,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,You'd better be more careful \Nas to what you agree to.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.28,0:17:00.00,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Too bad. We know you're hard up.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.00,0:17:01.25,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Huh? How did you know?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.46,0:17:05.58,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Anyway, what have you been doing lately?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.58,0:17:08.92,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Well, I'm trying to work hard \Nand buy my house back...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.92,0:17:11.83,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Buy it back? That'll never happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.83,0:17:14.22,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.77,0:17:14.22,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.33,0:17:17.34,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,W-Well...  That's right...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.34,0:17:20.22,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Well, let us know when you find a house.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.22,0:17:23.04,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,We'll at least send a New Year's \Ncard when you do, Kato.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.19,0:17:25.11,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Take a bath!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.11,0:17:26.28,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Brush your teeth!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.28,0:17:27.23,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,See you next week!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.89,0:17:30.11,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Hey, you...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.61,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.61,0:17:33.62,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Maybe you oughta rethink your request.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.62,0:17:37.39,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,I'm available for assassination jobs \Nsince I'm a professional killer.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.39,0:17:38.71,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Let's kill them!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.71,0:17:41.50,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Why don't we roll them up \Nand throw 'em into the ditch now?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.00,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.29,0:17:47.11,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I'm changing my request.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.11,0:17:49.67,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,But it's not going to be assassination.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.28,0:17:54.26,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I... want to be stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.98,0:17:56.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.64,0:17:57.97,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.29,0:18:03.94,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate, help him jack up \Nhis hit points another hundred or so.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.33,0:18:07.36,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,So where are you going, Gin?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.59,0:18:10.38,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I've got my own business to take care of.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.61,0:18:15.56,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.56,0:18:16.62,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.62,0:18:19.35,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is a blueprint...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.79,0:18:21.87,Main,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Isao Kondo.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.87,0:18:24.37,Main,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,Commander of the Shinsengumi. \NStrikes fear in the hearts of others.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.05,0:18:26.52,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,By the way, Hijikata...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.72,0:18:30.76,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,I have no idea what this says...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.76,0:18:36.46,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I've been trying to explain that this is \Na blueprint for an Amanto device, Kondo!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.72,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,I see. Some sort of device...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.47,0:18:46.02,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Yes, and someone seems to be planning to use \Nthat device for some heinous deed here in Edo.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.55,0:18:48.82,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Toshi...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.37,0:18:53.78,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,What does "heinous deed" mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.41,0:18:57.78,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You haven't heard a word I said!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.05,Thoughts,GINTOKI (M),0,0,0,,An embassy?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.56,0:19:20.75,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Gintoki.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.34,0:19:22.14,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Zura?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.41,0:19:24.77,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,It's not Zura. It's Katsura.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.82,0:19:27.86,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Kotaro Katsura. Member of the anti-foreign rebels.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.86,0:19:32.34,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,{\q2}An activist trying to rid Edo of aliens called Amanto.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.72,0:19:36.49,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Elizabeth. What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.49,0:19:39.46,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Gintoki, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.46,0:19:43.63,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Well...  you know, jogging, taking a walk,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.63,0:19:46.29,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,something like that... \NI'm not really sure, you know...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.14,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.38,0:19:51.01,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.01,0:19:54.43,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,I heard some dangerous \Nrumors around here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.34,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Rumors?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.34,0:20:00.85,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,I've heard about an Amanto who's \Nplotting to destroy all of Edo.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.08,0:20:04.66,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Why would an Amanto \Ndo something like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.66,0:20:10.06,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,I don't know...  But if it's true, \Nwe must punish them.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.64,0:20:13.60,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Gintoki, I don't know \Nwhat you're going to do,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.12,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,but you'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.12,0:20:17.82,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,The Embassy is considered foreign soil.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.82,0:20:20.84,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Foreign soil...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.72,0:20:23.95,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I should be careful, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.95,0:20:24.83,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Later, Zura.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.45,0:20:28.75,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,It's not Zura. It's Katsura.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.14,0:20:43.01,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,When did that hat come back into fashion?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.85,0:20:50.80,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Okay! Why don't you give it a try?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.80,0:20:52.15,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He can't do that!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.15,0:20:55.25,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? It's easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.25,0:20:58.11,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Suppress your inner "self" \Nand even you can look like Antonio Inoki.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.35,0:21:00.41,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.61,0:21:05.37,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Okay, you can start any time.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.49,0:21:07.62,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.63,0:21:17.20,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What? Your eyes are bloodshot.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.20,0:21:18.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Were you up all night playing Tetris?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.07,0:21:22.68,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,The game is just about to begin.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.93,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.93,0:21:27.10,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Something bad could happen \Nif you swing that toy around like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.32,0:21:31.39,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Did he notice my sword cane?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.91,0:21:36.51,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Whatever, but can you at least tell me \Nwhy you're trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.51,0:21:41.76,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb! We already \Nknow you're nosing around.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.76,0:21:45.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Wrong. That was Zura. It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.58,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,No need for more talk!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.21,0:21:53.25,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,An earthquake?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.13,0:22:01.05,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You're leaving yourself wide open!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.47,0:22:05.93,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You think you'll become \Nstronger like that?! Dumbass!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.86,0:22:09.54,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,You're surprisingly intense.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.54,0:22:11.81,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm sorry. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.93,0:22:16.06,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Get up! Stand up! Katoken!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.80,0:22:24.85,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Listen! Keep your elbows close to your \Nbody and strike, strike, and strike!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.85,0:22:27.84,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wait! That's a jab.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.84,0:22:29.40,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That won't work for tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.40,0:22:31.37,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It doesn't have anything to do \Nwith swordsmanship!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.37,0:22:34.21,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Cross Namida Bridge carefully!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.38,0:22:38.58,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,It looks like it's my turn.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.13,0:22:41.97,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,I'll make you stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.12,0:22:44.52,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,Stronger!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.52,0:22:46.74,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.74,0:22:48.59,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,More! More!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.59,0:22:50.36,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Oh yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.36,0:22:52.48,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,That's it. Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.48,0:22:54.02,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,How about this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.77,0:22:57.07,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,You have potential.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.07,0:22:58.85,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What is this training for?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.85,0:23:01.31,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What kind of potential does he have?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.31,0:23:02.38,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,As a dominatrix...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.38,0:23:05.41,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He's a man! Anyway, that's not the point!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.41,0:23:10.29,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Oh, you're very patient! \NYou'll get another appetizer!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.29,0:23:12.36,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Untie me now!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.36,0:23:14.04,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.51,0:23:18.13,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, but that's enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.45,0:23:21.93,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever get any stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.93,0:23:23.51,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I give up...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.51,0:23:25.50,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Huh? B-But...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.50,0:23:27.48,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,So I'll just leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.81,0:23:29.98,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Katoken...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.56,0:23:38.09,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Boy, my best clothes... ruined.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.09,0:23:40.44,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,My mom is going to \Nbe really mad, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.44,0:23:44.79,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,You'd better be more worried \Nabout your life than your clothes!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.24,0:23:53.37,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Who is Shishimura, \NGintoki's mysterious attacker?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.37,0:23:56.58,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,And what heinous deed \Nis Kariya the Amanto planning?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.09,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Did Kato really give up?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.89,0:24:09.04,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,It's time to say good-bye \Nto those who live in a certain area.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.04,0:24:12.70,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,For the rest of you, please keep watching!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:24.33,0:24:25.85,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,You've got some skill...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.85,0:24:27.61,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Are you a former Exclusionist rebel?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.88,0:24:30.24,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,And you're a former gangster, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.24,0:24:32.74,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have damaged your hair \Nwhen you were young.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.74,0:24:35.23,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,I don't have to take that from someone \Nwith naturally wavy hair!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.23,0:24:36.64,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You're breakin' my heart...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.64,0:24:39.58,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It's not like I wanted wavy hair!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.58,0:24:43.09,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,I'll kill you this time! \NYou'd better say your prayers!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.09,0:24:45.42,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shimura! Look out behind you.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.42,0:24:47.32,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm not Shimura...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:47.32,0:24:48.26,Main,POLICEMAN,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.26,0:24:50.82,Main,POLICEMAN,0,0,0,,What're you doing waving around \Na sword during a Sword Ban?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.82,0:24:52.73,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Um... Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.14,0:24:55.64,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Nice catch.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.64,0:24:58.90,Main,POLICEMAN,0,0,0,,Oh, I see, sideshow practice...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.90,0:25:00.96,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Yes! Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.96,0:25:02.23,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Right? Huh? Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.36,0:25:04.24,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.85,0:25:12.14,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What's all this? Enjoying your youth?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.14,0:25:16.12,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Just full of urge to go running off into the sunset, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.38,0:25:17.25,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.73,0:25:19.19,Main,SA,0,0,0,,We have to apologize, Gin.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.19,0:25:21.12,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Katoken left.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.54,0:25:22.79,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Katoken?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.79,0:25:24.48,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh, our client.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.48,0:25:26.97,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, get me down from here!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.97,0:25:28.97,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Ah well, so it goes.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.97,0:25:30.95,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,We're getting used to working for nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.95,0:25:33.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It's no use worrying about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.67,0:25:37.36,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I had a feeling when we took the job \Nthat it wouldn't work out. Really.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:37.36,0:25:38.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.02,0:25:41.14,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.14,0:25:44.86,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I didn't know Gin would be so cold-hearted.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:46.28,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That's how he is.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.28,0:25:49.40,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,He'll let anyone in, but doesn't stand \Nin their way if they want to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.70,0:25:52.63,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,By the way, Kagura, \Nwhy did you come to my house?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.63,0:25:54.47,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why are you eating my rice?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.47,0:25:56.34,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Because dinner was right next door.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.75,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's not next door!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.75,0:25:59.91,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,Why would you two say something like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.91,0:26:01.21,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Sis...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.33,0:26:05.52,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,7,,Otae. Shinpachi's big sister.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.52,0:26:09.04,Narrator,NARRATOR,0,0,1,,Works part-time in order to save \Nthe dojo her father left her.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:09.04,0:26:13.22,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,If you don't believe in Gin, who will?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.55,0:26:17.77,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,No! He doesn't deserve it, Otae.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.77,0:26:19.11,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Like I've been saying,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:19.11,0:26:23.48,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,you can't trust a guy \Nwho has the eyes of a dead fish.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.56,0:26:27.78,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,You're the bastard! You stalker!
Comment: 50,0:26:28.15,0:26:29.70,Main,OTAE,0,0,0,,I'll finish you off!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.78,0:26:30.12,Main,KAZURA,0,0,0,,Is he still stalking her?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.12,0:26:33.24,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.57,0:26:37.24,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I wonder what Gin is doing now.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.65,0:26:54.13,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You want some?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.64,0:26:57.72,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.72,0:27:00.96,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Red beans over rice, a Gintoki special!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.96,0:27:02.52,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,N-No thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.24,0:27:13.98,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,This is good sake.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.98,0:27:17.16,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Helps me forget all my worries for a moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.16,0:27:20.15,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But I'll be reminded of them tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.15,0:27:23.97,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,And I think they'll be even bigger \Nheadaches than they were today.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.23,0:27:27.79,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It is not like you can run away from them.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.79,0:27:28.69,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Especially...
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.05,0:27:32.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,...those things you really want to forget.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.31,0:27:39.76,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I may have wanted an excuse.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.14,0:27:41.64,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,An excuse?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.30,0:27:49.77,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I already told you that I was fired, \Nmy house was taken from me,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.77,0:27:51.86,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,and my family left me, didn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.25,0:27:57.51,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Before that, I used to be \Na salesman for a company.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.32,0:28:01.03,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I kept working for the sake \Nof my family day after day...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.03,0:28:03.49,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,And we were finally \Nable to buy our own house.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.25,0:28:05.81,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I was happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:05.81,0:28:10.11,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I believed that I could \Nkeep working for them. But...
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.32,0:28:13.49,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I still don't understand it.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.49,0:28:17.59,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong, \Nbut I was fired from the company.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.59,0:28:19.98,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,So, I went and got drunk,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.98,0:28:23.04,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,and those guys stamped my seal \Non a contract without my permission.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.89,0:28:26.65,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Then the land shark came \Nand showed us the bogus contract,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.65,0:28:29.81,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,saying I had to leave my house.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.81,0:28:35.17,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,My wife couldn't stand their \Nharassment and left with my daughter.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.44,0:28:45.50,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I said that something happened \Nto me every week, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.50,0:28:47.77,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,What do you think happened last week then?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.77,0:28:49.21,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.32,0:28:52.29,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,A letter?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.29,0:28:58.01,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Yes. My daughter sent me \Na letter right before my eviction.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.60,0:29:05.89,Main,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,"Daddy, I want to come home soon."
Dialogue: 50,0:29:16.87,0:29:19.81,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,By then, I had given up on everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.81,0:29:23.66,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,But after reading her letter, \NI wanted to give it another try.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.91,0:29:27.59,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Does that sound stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.59,0:29:32.24,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I believed that if I got my house back, \Nmy family would return.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.94,0:29:36.42,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,But now I realize...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.42,0:29:38.63,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I'm useless.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.63,0:29:40.97,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Even though I worked so hard...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.43,0:29:40.97,Secondary,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:42.02,0:29:43.11,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.05,0:29:45.60,Main,COOK,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.72,0:29:49.73,Main,COOK,0,0,0,,Sir, your bill.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.40,0:29:58.29,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um... Sorry, but since I'm unemployed, \Ncan we split the bill at least?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:58.29,0:29:59.72,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Let's go, Katoken!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.72,0:30:01.11,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Huh? To where?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.39,0:30:04.49,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What? Don't you want to \Nget the contract back?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:04.49,0:30:06.08,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Th-Then...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.52,0:30:09.25,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I'm Odd Jobs Gin. I'll do anything for...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:11.17,0:30:13.21,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.54,0:30:17.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Can we postpone the raid until tomorrow?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:17.50,0:30:18.51,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.51,0:30:19.91,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Did I drink too much?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.91,0:30:23.05,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,My head feels like it's shaking.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.05,0:30:27.49,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,No, this is an earthquake...I think.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.49,0:30:29.31,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Urgh! I can't hold it anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.79,0:30:32.85,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I feel I'm going to throw up, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:34.40,0:30:37.11,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You don't have to...
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.20,0:30:43.11,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Man, what a headache.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.66,0:30:46.38,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,This is a total hangover.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.38,0:30:47.58,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I need some water.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:47.95,0:30:49.64,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Leave it to Gin.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.64,0:30:51.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I knew we would do something like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.87,0:30:56.71,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Really? You said Gin \Nwas cold-hearted, didn't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:56.71,0:30:58.43,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.43,0:31:00.13,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You said that he lets anyone in, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.41,0:31:03.39,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shut up! Stop talking so loudly.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:03.39,0:31:05.34,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,It really hurts my head.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:07.03,0:31:09.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh, here it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.45,0:31:13.49,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We'll get Katoken's contract back, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.49,0:31:15.70,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,How do we sneak in?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.70,0:31:20.16,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Huh? We're not going to \Nsneak in, we're going to break in.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.16,0:31:24.57,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That means we'll storm in through the front.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.57,0:31:25.15,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin...
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.28,0:31:26.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Knock knock!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:28.91,0:31:29.60,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.60,0:31:32.83,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Bunta! Are you channeling your inner Bunta?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.83,0:31:35.30,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hello! Anyone here?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.30,0:31:37.58,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You don't need \Nto let them know we're here.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.58,0:31:41.09,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Strange. There doesn't seem \Nto be anyone here.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.54,0:32:01.27,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's still warm. There were people \Nhere mere moments ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.27,0:32:03.53,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That's right. This is really warm.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:03.98,0:32:07.32,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,This meat is too tender to be meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:07.32,0:32:09.71,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:09.71,0:32:12.89,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Well, we're not supposed to \Nwaste food, are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:12.89,0:32:14.54,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Saving the best for last.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:14.54,0:32:15.93,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,You guys are like pigs!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.11,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What will you do if there's poison in it?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:18.11,0:32:20.52,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Don't worry. There's no poison in it.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:26.80,0:32:30.49,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Are these the ones \Nwho have been sniffing around?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.49,0:32:31.72,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Yes, Mr. Kariya.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.13,0:32:34.22,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Kato, is that you?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:34.22,0:32:35.18,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.42,0:32:37.26,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:37.26,0:32:41.27,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Say, aren't you embarrassed \Nfor laying a stupid trap like this?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:41.55,0:32:45.35,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Aren't you embarassed \Nfor getting caught in it?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.35,0:32:49.12,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'm ok with a trap \Nwith slightly stronger flavor!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:49.12,0:32:50.41,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,You listen to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:50.67,0:32:53.49,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys! \NGive us back Katoken's contract!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:53.89,0:32:54.88,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:54.88,0:32:55.96,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:55.96,0:32:58.75,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,You're telling us you guys \Ncame all this way just for that?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.30,0:33:00.54,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,So what if we did?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:03.48,0:33:06.90,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,It looks like Shishimura overestimated \Nthe threat they pose.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.90,0:33:08.59,Main,SHIHSIMURA,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:08.59,0:33:09.93,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Let's go. We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:09.93,0:33:11.51,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,But what should I do with these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:11.51,0:33:12.76,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Just throw them out.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.17,0:33:17.51,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Kato.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:17.51,0:33:20.78,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Soon, you won't have to worry \Nabout your house or anything else.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:20.78,0:33:24.23,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,You'll get flattened in here anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:25.09,0:33:26.98,Main,KATO,0,0,0,,Flattened?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:27.88,0:33:29.49,Main,ANNOUNCE,0,0,0,,Course gate open!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:29.49,0:33:32.03,Main,ANNOUNCE,0,0,0,,Higashi-Murayama One, \Nprepare for launch.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:32.03,0:33:35.34,Main,ANNOUNCE,0,0,0,,Higashi-Murayama One, \Nprepare for launch.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:37.29,0:33:38.95,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:38.95,0:33:39.66,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:56.49,0:33:57.97,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Enjoy this view while you can.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.24,0:34:00.94,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,This is your last view of Edo.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:06.24,0:34:07.57,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:07.57,0:34:09.82,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Help me, you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:09.82,0:34:12.39,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, Kagura! Please help us.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:12.39,0:34:13.59,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Save us with your Yato strength.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:13.59,0:34:15.07,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I ain't falling for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:15.07,0:34:17.93,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I won't move until I finish all the food.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:17.93,0:34:19.35,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:20.50,0:34:21.96,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:21.96,0:34:23.42,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:23.42,0:34:25.79,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Ah, Zura must be here, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:26.13,0:34:28.17,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,It's not Zura. It's Katsura.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:28.74,0:34:33.38,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,While you guys were living it up, \Nwe snuck in the back.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:33.38,0:34:35.59,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,And we found something in the safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:35.83,0:34:38.60,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What? Did you find it? \NIs that Katoken's contract?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:38.60,0:34:42.23,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,I don't know anything \Nabout that. But look at this.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:43.36,0:34:47.27,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I would, but... I'm having \Na hard time with small print.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:47.51,0:34:50.11,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,What do you think about \Nthese documents, Gintoki?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:51.06,0:34:53.11,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:53.38,0:34:55.05,Main,KATSUYA,0,0,0,,Then let me explain.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:55.05,0:34:57.87,Main,KATSUYA,0,0,0,,They intend to raze Edo to the ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:34:57.87,0:34:59.07,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:59.07,0:35:00.23,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,They intend to have a rave in Edo?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:00.23,0:35:01.62,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He said "raze," stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:03.10,0:35:05.42,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Let me give you a brief explanation.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:06.56,0:35:10.50,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,They discovered an earthquake fault line
Dialogue: 50,0:35:10.85,0:35:14.25,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,and they stimulated that point \Nwith an Amanto-made device.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:14.25,0:35:17.01,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,It will cause a giant artificial earthquake.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:17.01,0:35:20.31,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,{\t(2274,0,0.8,\c&HFDFCFD&\3c&HFDFCFD&\4c&HFDFCFD&)}And Edo will be destroyed!
Dialogue: 50,0:35:20.56,0:35:22.15,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:22.15,0:35:24.89,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That sounds like some kind of \Nevil anime organization.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:24.89,0:35:26.81,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,But why would they do \Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:27.20,0:35:29.98,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Those people who were \Nwith Kariya are land sharks.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:29.98,0:35:34.70,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,They snatch up homes lost by others for cheap.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:35.35,0:35:37.03,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,And their goal is the old city?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:37.31,0:35:40.75,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Buildings that weren't constructed \Nby Amanto are not very strong.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:40.75,0:35:43.79,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,If a big earthquake hits, \Nthey'll collapse in a moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:43.79,0:35:46.63,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oh no! Edo will...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:46.63,0:35:50.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,But we don't know where the point is.
Dialogue: 50,0:35:50.67,0:35:52.25,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Aren't there any clues?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:52.25,0:35:54.51,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Well, unfortunately...
Dialogue: 50,0:35:54.75,0:35:56.35,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 50,0:35:56.35,0:36:01.30,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We don't have time to find \Nthe land sharks in Edo!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:02.89,0:36:05.14,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Kagura! You've had enough food, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:05.14,0:36:06.65,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Break us out of this cage!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:06.65,0:36:07.60,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:11.72,0:36:14.16,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Why didn't you do this earlier?!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:14.16,0:36:14.79,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Katoken!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:14.79,0:36:15.74,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:15.74,0:36:17.74,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Where is your house?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:20.80,0:36:21.74,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Hey, Gintoki!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:21.98,0:36:23.53,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:23.53,0:36:25.12,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,It's dangerous if you go alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:25.12,0:36:28.06,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,I know, but we still have to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:28.06,0:36:29.21,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,See you, Zura.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:29.21,0:36:31.21,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,It's not Zura! It's Katsura!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:31.21,0:36:33.63,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Gin! What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:33.63,0:36:39.26,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Basically, their goal is to clear the land \Nin Edo and then sell it at a higher price.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:39.26,0:36:40.43,Main,SINPACHI,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 50,0:36:40.72,0:36:44.64,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Then why did they clear \NKatoken's house first?
Dialogue: 50,0:36:44.89,0:36:46.84,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:36:46.84,0:36:48.08,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:48.08,0:36:49.44,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's the earthquake fault line!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:49.44,0:36:51.06,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:51.06,0:36:54.53,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,So him getting fired and scammed \Nand having his house taken away ...
Dialogue: 50,0:36:54.53,0:36:56.45,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,All part of their plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:36:56.45,0:36:57.47,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,That's terrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:57.47,0:36:58.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:58.99,0:36:59.51,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Yah!
Dialogue: 50,0:36:59.51,0:37:01.49,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um, if I may...
Dialogue: 50,0:37:01.80,0:37:02.73,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:37:02.73,0:37:05.25,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,If you have something to say, say it now!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:05.25,0:37:06.37,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:06.37,0:37:07.87,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,We have no time to lose.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:07.87,0:37:11.38,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Then I'll say it. We missed a turn.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:11.94,0:37:13.49,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:16.47,0:37:22.89,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,So, this is the Drift Star \Nearthquake machine, hehe!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:22.89,0:37:26.78,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,And this device will realize \NMr. Kariya's ambition!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:26.78,0:37:29.79,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Our time will come soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:37:29.79,0:37:30.56,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:30.56,0:37:31.47,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:40.61,0:37:42.67,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Rock drilling beam activated!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:42.67,0:37:45.12,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Ten minutes to reach the target!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:46.32,0:37:48.80,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Go! No one can stop us!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:48.80,0:37:51.62,Main,SAMURAI GUARDS,0,0,0,,Intruders! Get them! Get them!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:50.97,0:37:51.62,Secondary,KARIYA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:37:53.98,0:37:55.41,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,This is a raid!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:55.41,0:37:57.80,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We're the Shinsengumi! \NGive it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:37:59.51,0:38:01.84,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Government dogs!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:05.51,0:38:07.87,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're ready \Nto take on the Shinsengumi?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:07.87,0:38:08.72,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:09.05,0:38:11.14,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,I'm Isao Kondo!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:11.14,0:38:13.90,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Toshiro Hijikata!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:13.90,0:38:16.61,Main,OKITA,0,0,0,,Sogo Okita!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:16.61,0:38:18.11,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:19.17,0:38:20.82,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:22.02,0:38:25.66,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,What did you say? No, you hold it!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:26.11,0:38:27.88,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Let me spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:27.88,0:38:30.49,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,This is Drift Star territory.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:30.49,0:38:34.42,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,If you take a single step into this house, \Nit'll be an international incident.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:35.19,0:38:37.05,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Damn it! Extraterritoriality, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:37.05,0:38:39.05,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:38:39.05,0:38:41.63,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's extraterritoriality?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:42.00,0:38:46.81,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,If you want to get into the house, \Nyou need to go through official procedures.
Dialogue: 50,0:38:50.40,0:38:52.23,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Sogo, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:52.23,0:38:56.33,Main,OKITA,0,0,0,,Well, if I tore down this house, \Nwe could go inside, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:56.33,0:38:58.36,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Are you Mr. Ikkyu or something?
Dialogue: 50,0:38:58.69,0:39:01.74,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Feh... If you understand, \Nthen you'd better leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:39:07.03,0:39:09.87,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Thanks for the assistance! \NMake way for the star!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:09.87,0:39:10.94,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 50,0:39:10.94,0:39:11.75,Main,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Odd Jobs?
Dialogue: 50,0:39:12.72,0:39:13.37,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,He's here...
Dialogue: 50,0:39:13.93,0:39:15.42,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to us!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:17.11,0:39:20.00,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Odd Jobs Gin will take care of the problem!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:22.46,0:39:24.84,Main,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Since he's not from government, \Nhe can do whatever he likes!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:24.84,0:39:26.43,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,It's becoming a habit...
Dialogue: 50,0:39:29.93,0:39:32.02,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Mr. Kariya, let's go inside.
Dialogue: 50,0:39:32.81,0:39:34.27,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:34.73,0:39:37.06,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,It's time you and I settled this.
Dialogue: 50,0:39:37.43,0:39:41.19,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't go thinking you're \Nmy rival, Mr. Sideshow!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:41.19,0:39:42.11,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:47.99,0:39:50.03,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Five minutes until we reach the target!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:50.03,0:39:53.33,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Good. Allow it to approach \Nthe epicenter and pull out!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:53.33,0:39:53.87,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:39:53.87,0:39:55.75,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Machine, surface!
Dialogue: 50,0:40:00.46,0:40:01.23,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,An Earthquake?
Dialogue: 50,0:40:01.23,0:40:01.92,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Did they already...?
Dialogue: 50,0:40:17.90,0:40:18.82,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:40:18.82,0:40:21.28,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,What the hell is this world-ending contraption? 
Dialogue: 50,0:40:21.28,0:40:24.15,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,This is too much, even \Nfor a special two-part episode!
Dialogue: 50,0:40:24.73,0:40:26.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,So this is the device \Nthat Zura was talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:40:31.12,0:40:36.04,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Excellent. Our plan is \Non the verge of success.
Dialogue: 50,0:40:36.04,0:40:38.94,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,No! Edo will...
Dialogue: 50,0:40:41.21,0:40:43.09,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shinpachi!
Dialogue: 50,0:40:43.09,0:40:44.96,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,You'll have to fight me.
Dialogue: 50,0:40:45.49,0:40:46.72,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 50,0:40:48.72,0:40:51.22,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Three minutes until we reach the target!
Dialogue: 50,0:40:54.60,0:40:56.60,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,M-My house...
Dialogue: 50,0:40:56.60,0:40:57.27,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:40:57.27,0:40:58.44,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Katoken!
Dialogue: 50,0:40:58.44,0:41:00.81,Main,SAMURAI A,0,0,0,,Dumbass! Why did you leave him alone?
Dialogue: 50,0:41:00.81,0:41:03.19,Main,SAMURAI B,0,0,0,,Well, he didn't seem like much of a threat.
Dialogue: 50,0:41:03.19,0:41:05.78,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Go, Katoken! Stop them!
Dialogue: 50,0:41:05.78,0:41:07.79,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 50,0:41:12.77,0:41:14.23,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,I'll cut you down.
Dialogue: 50,0:41:18.76,0:41:20.12,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 50,0:41:20.12,0:41:21.50,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:41:22.84,0:41:26.42,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You have to change first, \Nor nothing will change for you.
Dialogue: 50,0:41:27.22,0:41:28.26,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Change...?
Dialogue: 50,0:41:28.26,0:41:31.01,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You can't run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:41:31.01,0:41:34.71,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Especially from those things \Nyou really want to forget!
Dialogue: 50,0:41:52.88,0:41:54.55,Flashbacks,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 50,0:41:59.03,0:42:00.58,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 50,0:42:01.10,0:42:02.78,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.30,0:42:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I will change!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:07.92,0:42:10.84,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,If I suppress my inner "self", \Nmy face will look just like Antonio Inoki's!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:11.07,0:42:11.63,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:42:11.63,0:42:13.01,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:42:13.01,0:42:14.14,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,You're bluffing!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:14.14,0:42:17.43,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Keep my elbow to my side and just strike...
Dialogue: 50,0:42:20.48,0:42:22.19,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:23.94,0:42:25.73,Main,KARIYA,0,0,0,,Oh, this sucks!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:27.98,0:42:29.78,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:30.72,0:42:32.08,Main,PUU,0,0,0,,Mr. Kariya!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:32.08,0:42:33.28,Main,SHIMOMOTO,0,0,0,,Help him!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:36.78,0:42:40.01,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of my student! \NHe's become really strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:40.01,0:42:43.54,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Kagura, you taught him how \Nto jab, not how to stab.
Dialogue: 50,0:42:43.54,0:42:44.99,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Katoken?
Dialogue: 50,0:42:44.99,0:42:46.67,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Go and stop the machine now!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:46.67,0:42:47.54,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,A-All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:42:51.04,0:42:52.05,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:42:52.49,0:42:53.18,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 50,0:43:01.27,0:43:03.14,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Fifty seconds left?! But the speed was doubled,
Dialogue: 50,0:43:03.14,0:43:04.77,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,so there's only twenty-five seconds left!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:04.77,0:43:07.40,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Hurry! Just stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:07.82,0:43:09.51,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Um... Is this it?
Dialogue: 50,0:43:09.51,0:43:11.40,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Or this...?
Dialogue: 50,0:43:11.40,0:43:12.74,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,This must be it!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:14.89,0:43:15.91,Main,KATO,0,0,0,,It broke!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:15.91,0:43:18.33,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,I knew that would happen! It broke!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:20.71,0:43:21.33,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:21.72,0:43:22.70,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,We didn't finish our fight yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:23.51,0:43:26.80,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Shut up, you flunkie! \NI don't have time to waste on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:26.80,0:43:28.09,Main,SHISHIMURA,0,0,0,,One hit and I'm down?
Dialogue: 50,0:43:33.47,0:43:34.88,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:40.79,0:43:42.49,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,I-It stopped...
Dialogue: 50,0:43:42.49,0:43:43.93,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:43.93,0:43:45.06,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,A-All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:49.57,0:43:50.15,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:50.15,0:43:51.48,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:43:54.40,0:43:57.18,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,Hey, you know if you take \Na single step across that line
Dialogue: 50,0:43:57.18,0:43:59.55,Main,KONDO,0,0,0,,your territorial law won't mean shit!
Dialogue: 50,0:44:02.56,0:44:04.63,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,Not bad, Gintoki.
Dialogue: 50,0:44:05.59,0:44:06.87,Main,KATSURA,0,0,0,,My side hurts.
Dialogue: 50,0:44:12.86,0:44:15.97,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Our... house...
Dialogue: 50,0:44:19.69,0:44:20.72,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Sakata...
Dialogue: 50,0:44:20.72,0:44:23.55,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Don't worry about your house.
Dialogue: 50,0:44:23.55,0:44:24.93,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 50,0:44:26.13,0:44:27.98,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,You've changed, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:44:29.03,0:44:30.02,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:44:37.36,0:44:39.43,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,It's Kuromi of Yamatoya!
Dialogue: 50,0:44:41.52,0:44:44.59,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, you stupid cat, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:44:52.35,0:44:55.26,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Why can't I have a Bankai \Nor something like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:44:55.98,0:44:57.93,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,Gin, look at the TV!
Dialogue: 50,0:44:59.13,0:45:02.97,Main,KATOKEN,0,0,0,,{\k11}{\k31\2c&H6EE7F2&}Sam{\k48}ba!{\k40} {\k70}Oh, {\k23}Ka{\k24}to{\k26}ken {\k49}sam{\k62}ba!
Dialogue: 50,0:45:04.07,0:45:05.91,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Hey, can this be...
Dialogue: 50,0:45:05.91,0:45:08.49,Main,KAGURA,0,0,0,,That's it! That's Katoken!
Dialogue: 50,0:45:08.49,0:45:14.74,Main,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Katoken's gaining \Npopularity as a dancing enka singer.
Dialogue: 50,0:45:14.74,0:45:15.78,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 50,0:45:15.78,0:45:23.12,Main,,0,0,0,,{\k49\2c&H6EE7F2&}O{\k105}le{\k0},{\k37} {\k44}O{\k183}le{\k0}, {\k50}Ka{\k43}to{\k51}ke{\k46}n {\k33}Sam{\k47}ba!
Dialogue: 50,0:45:23.33,0:45:30.67,Main,,0,0,0,,{\k49\2c&H6EE7F2&}O{\k105}le{\k0},{\k37} {\k44}O{\k183}le{\k0}, {\k50}Ka{\k43}to{\k51}ke{\k46}n {\k33}Sam{\k93}ba!
Dialogue: 50,0:45:30.96,0:45:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,{\k49\fad(0,400)\2c&H6EE7F2&}O{\k685}le
Dialogue: 50,0:45:21.14,0:45:23.12,Main,GINTOKI,0,0,0,,{\pos(380,496)}He looks so happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:47:05.91,0:47:09.09,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,One year ago, I met this man.
Dialogue: 50,0:47:09.09,0:47:12.30,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,He was too fierce to be called a samurai,
Dialogue: 50,0:47:12.30,0:47:15.94,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,but too focused to be called a thug.
Dialogue: 50,0:47:15.94,0:47:16.76,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,The next episode:
Dialogue: 50,0:47:16.76,0:47:19.04,Narrator,SHINPACHI,0,0,0,,"Nobody with Naturally \NWavy Hair Can Be That Bad."
Dialogue: 50,0:47:42.98,0:47:44.93,Main,SACHAN,0,0,0,,I forgot to appear in second part of the show.
