Dialogue: 51,0:07:23.96,0:07:27.89,Notes,Names/History,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H000000&\blur0.4}The Shinsengumi was a special police force made up of samurai who served the Tokugawa shogunate, tasked with maintaining order and suppressing anti-shogunate forces in Kyoto during Japan's late Edo Period.
