Dialogue: 51,0:07:27.89,0:07:31.39,Notes,Names/History,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H000000&\blur0.4}Hijikata Toshizou was the vice-commander of the Shinsengumi, known as its strict disciplinarian and skilled swordsman, earning him the nickname "Demon Vice-Commander."
