Dialogue: 51,0:15:14.06,0:15:19.52,Notes,Names/History,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H000000&\blur0.4}The surname Sarutobi is famously associated with the ninja Sasuke Sarutobi. The Oniwaban (御庭番) were a group of spies and intelligence agents serving the Tokugawa shogunate, working directly under the Shogun.
