Dialogue: 51,0:19:21.34,0:19:24.77,Notes,Others,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H000000&\blur0.4}Katsura means wig in Japanese while Zura is a slang for wig too.\N So when Katsura insists his name is Katsura by saying, \N"It's not Zura. It's Katsura", he is essentially saying, "It's not a wig. It's wig"
