Dialogue: 51,0:22:16.80,0:22:31.37,Notes,Anime/Manga,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1c&H000000&\blur0.4}The explanation of how to jab references the popular anime/manga series \N{\i1}Ashita no Joe{\i0} (Tomorrow's Joe), where each lesson begins with the phrase 「明日のために」 ({\i1}Ashita no tame ni{\i0}, "For tomorrow"). Shinpachi also uses this phrase here, implying that Kato Ken's training is part of preparing for tomorrow.
